(text "Two adjacent 0603 LEDs feed one diffused light pipe above the display.\nGreen 80-100%; both channels yellow 30-79%; red 0-29%. Each GPIO is current limited locally.\nThe always-on controller supplies PWM; this indicator remains available when key RGB is off." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid e0ad3116-ad50-4442-9766-1c965695f1f8))
